   419	    /// Completion toggle. Completing stamps `completedAt`, captures the
   420	    /// entry's context snapshot when it is the first-ever completion (D23),
   421	    /// and upserts GymExerciseMemory. Un-completing clears the stamp only —
   422	    /// the equipment freeze survives (D19).
   423	    ///
   424	    /// A1: completing an empty (or under-specified) row throws
   425	    /// `WorkoutSessionError.setNotLoggable` — an unlogged set is honest, a set
