codex
Two high-risk seams are emerging from inspection: template-based history titles read the live template table, and the new completion gate consults the live exercise load type even after the entry snapshot freezes. Both are directly at odds with D23’s snapshot contract. I’m now running the full shared scheme while tracing deletion and equipment-switch edge cases.
